dist/native/opencascade/geospec_opencascade_single.wasm and its loader
geospec_opencascade_single.js are a WebAssembly build of Open CASCADE
Technology (OCCT), upstream commit b8f597c677811d1f9f4d8a97f5ae2825c0353a42,
compiled through opencascade.js commit a0b2b3cd611d502681b31e6fb2f9c018146494fd
with @libcascade/toolchain, together with GeoSpec's own XDE reader wrapper.
This package uses facilities provided by the Open CASCADE Technology software.

OCCT is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License 2.1 with the
Open CASCADE exception. Their unmodified texts accompany this package as
licenses/OCCT-LGPL-2.1.txt and licenses/OCCT-LGPL-exception.txt.

The exact build inputs are recorded beside the binary in
geospec_opencascade_single.provenance.json. The build declaration
(libcascade.config.ts) and the wrapper source are published in the Tau
repository under packages/geospec-engine/native/opencascade, and the OCCT
source is available upstream at the commit above, so the WebAssembly module can
be rebuilt from modified OCCT sources and dropped in beside its loader.

